stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Home
  Home --> Incident: Diagnose reload / exit / jank / background failure
  Incident --> DirectEvidence: Query available direct OS history
  DirectEvidence --> Attribution: sufficient evidence
  DirectEvidence --> EvidenceGap: missing / denied / conflicting
  EvidenceGap --> Snapshot: Tier 1 cheap snapshot
  Snapshot --> Attribution
  EvidenceGap --> TriggerTrace: Tier 2 triggered trace if supported + justified
  TriggerTrace --> Attribution
  EvidenceGap --> PrivRead: Tier 3 explicit read session if necessary
  PrivRead --> Attribution
  Attribution --> Unknown: unresolved / mixed evidence
  Attribution --> Guidance: platform/vendor policy guidance
  Attribution --> Baseline: measurable resource/continuity cause
  Unknown --> Incident: refine/reproduce
  Guidance --> Verify: user applies supported setting if desired
  Verify --> Incident: repeat workflow
  Baseline --> Shadow: paired/repeated experiment
  Shadow --> NoOp: no repeatable benefit / regression / unsafe
  Shadow --> SafetyReview: future qualified typed candidate
  SafetyReview --> NoOp: qualification/rollback gate fails
  SafetyReview --> Applied: bounded canary
  Applied --> Recovered: failure -> rollback
  Applied --> Attribution: verified outcome evidence
  Recovered --> Attribution
  NoOp --> Attribution
